sequenceDiagram
    participant CLI as CLI / ContextManager
    participant Idx as Indexer
    participant Chk as Treesitter
    participant Emb as Embedder (Ollama / Transformers)
    participant FS as FileSystem
    participant Cache as Embeddings Cache

    CLI->>Idx: Indexer.create({ provider, model, chunker })
    Idx->>Emb: loadEmbedder({ concurrency: 5 })
    Emb->>Emb: initialize() → load model
    Emb->>Emb: getDimensions() → N dimensions
    Emb-->>Idx: Embedder ready
    Idx->>Chk: loadChunker()
    Chk-->>Idx: Chunker ready

    CLI->>Idx: index({ projectPath, cacheDir, include, exclude })

    Idx->>FS: fast-glob(include, { ignore: exclude })
    FS-->>Idx: Array of file paths

    loop For each file
        Idx->>FS: readFile(filePath, 'utf-8')
        FS-->>Idx: File content

        Idx->>Chk: parseCodeFile(file, content)
        Chk->>Chk: Tree-sitter AST parse
        Chk->>Chk: Extract functions, classes, methods, variables
        Chk-->>Idx: Chunks with metadata (type, startRow, endRow, names)
    end

    Note over Idx,Emb: Concurrent embedding (5 workers)
    Idx->>Idx: generateEmbeddings(allChunkTexts, progressCallback)

    par Worker pool
        loop Queue of chunks
            Emb->>Emb: embed(text) → vector
            Emb-->>Idx: Embedding vector (or failure)
        end
    end

    Idx->>Idx: Filter out failed embeddings (preserve alignment)

    Idx->>Cache: writeToCache → embeddings_<projectName>.json
    Note over Cache: Format: { chunks[], model, dimensions, total, timestamp }
    Cache-->>Idx: File saved

    Idx->>Idx: emit('done', IndexResult)
    Idx-->>CLI: IndexResult { embedFile, dimensions, model, timestamp }
